    <p>Apartment dogs in the South End, Back Bay, Charlestown and Seaport need midday walks, and owners who travel for work or holidays book overnight sitters well ahead. Rover and Wag help you get your first reviews; after that, referrals in your building or block do the selling.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $20–$35/walk, $60–$100/night</li><li><b>Startup:</b> $0</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Animal lovers</li></ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hustle-card">
    <h3 id="freelancing">8. Freelance science and tech writing</h3>
    <p>Biotech startups, hospitals and universities constantly need grant support, website copy, slide decks, white papers and newsletters. A science or healthcare background turns you from a generic writer into a specialist who can charge specialist rates. Start with samples on <a href="/fiverr/">Fiverr</a>, then pitch Kendall Square and Seaport companies directly.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $40–$100/hr</li><li><b>Startup:</b> Laptop</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Scientists, clear writers</li></ul>
  </div>
</div>
